{"id":"n62835-4-5","stage":0,"title":"것 · 表示某种行为、状态或事情。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62835-4-5-1","ko":"취미가 뭐예요?","zh":"您的爱好是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"취미가","meaning":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","explanation":"취미：爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"취미","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72149","senseId":"1","lemma":"취미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취미가","audio":"/audio/a0b912ba5fcf1bba700a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐예요","audio":"/audio/4f5cef3090eaab6a16ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fce0e79fcf68c195","term":"취미","zh":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3","entryId":"72149","definition":"喜欢而为了乐趣做的事。","pronunciation":["취ː미"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/38e86bfa267980a68171.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62835-4-5-2","ko":"시간이 있을 땐 멀리 여행 가는 것을 좋아해요.","zh":"有空的时候，我喜欢去远方旅行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"있을","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을","audio":"/au